    <description>Tutanota is the world's most secure email service, easy to use and private by design. Sign up for free encrypted email now.

With end-to-end encryption and 2FA, your emails have never been more secure. The built-in encryption guarantees that your mailbox belongs to you: Nobody can decrypt or read your data.

**Please Note**: This is an automatically updated package. If you find it is out of date by more than a day or two, please contact the maintainer(s) and let them know the package is no longer updating correctly.</description>
    <summary>Tutanota is an email client with a strong focus on security and privacy that lets you encrypt emails on all your devices.</summary>
    <releaseNotes># What's new
 - unsupported TZID in iCal causes entire import to fail [#11325](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11325)
 - Handle redundant time zone info UTC and timestamp with Z at the end [#11248](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11248)

# Bugfixes
 - If start date is before given end date due to time zone difference, date displayed in event preview is misleading [#11276](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11276)
 - when end date is in a different time zone, user cannot specify a valid date in the event editor date picker [#11266](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11266)
 - When importing many events, only one event gets imported, with error message "ownerEncSessionKey already set" [#11246](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11246)
 - Events at midnight at event banner don't show up [#11213](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11213)
 - No error popup after setting end time before start time by selecting different start and end time zones [#11210](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11210)
 - Calendar does not update to reflect updated invitations to events from Google Calendar [#11148](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11148)
 - End date flickers and rapidly cycles through dates in event editor [#10548](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/10548)

# Milestone
https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/milestone/453?closed=1


